            "value": "<p>Most chocolate comes with a hidden cost—to your health and to the planet. We decided to change the script.</p><p>At The Conscious Bar, we combine superfoods like organic cacao and dates to create an indulgence that heals rather than harms. From the forests of Uganda to our plastic-free packaging, every decision we make is rooted in respect. We aren't just selling bars; we are leading a movement towards conscious consumption.</p>"
