        "row_3qWLAW": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Growth Mindset",
            "value": "<p>Just like our ingredients, we want you to grow naturally. We support experimentation, learning new tools, and taking ownership of your projects. If you have a better way to do it, we want to see it.</p>"
